sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as GamePage / MainWindow
    participant L as library/launcher.py
    participant P as compatibility/proton.py
    participant PT as library/playtime.py
    participant S as Steam / OS

    UI->>L: launch(game)
    alt Source.STEAM
        L->>S: steam://rungameid/<app_id>
        L->>PT: stamp last_played
    else Source.MINECRAFT
        L->>S: run instance launcher
        L->>PT: start session
    else Source.STANDALONE (.exe)
        L->>P: launch_exe(game_dir, exe)
        P->>S: wine/proton run
        L->>PT: start session
    else Source.STANDALONE (native)
        L->>S: spawn executable (cwd=game dir)
        L->>PT: start session
    end
    PT-->>L: Popen (or None)
    L-->>UI: return
    Note over PT: session accumulates playtime while child alive
